{
  "name": "Sales Agent 2 - Reply handler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sales Agent 2: Replies\n\nPolls Gmail every minute for unread mail, matches the sender against the Leads sheet, classifies the reply with the AI model and routes it.\n\n- **interested**: replies with your booking link (only if `autoSend` = true, otherwise you get a notification with a suggested reply)\n- **question / other**: emails you the lead's message + suggested reply\n- **not_now**: marks `follow_up_later`\n- **unsubscribe**: marks `do_not_contact` (never emailed again)\n\nKeep emails in the sheet lowercase so the lookup matches.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
